; equations.claims — accept a move that CANNOT break the law, to force a
; `stale` finding. `conclude` writes only `stage`, never an arrow the equation
; mentions, so declaring it as breaking `same-agency` is stale. Meanwhile
; `capture-watchdog` (which CAN break it) is left unaccepted, so it is reported
; as `undeclared`. `pol check equations.pol --claims equations.claims` prints
; both tokens.

(accept conclude same-agency)
